# business：给汇报 PPT 与展示平台用。线条更粗、线端圆头、子图标题加粗，投影到大屏也看得清
lines.linewidth: 2.6
lines.solid_capstyle: round
lines.dash_capstyle: round
axes.titlesize: 11.5
axes.titleweight: bold
axes.grid: True
axes.grid.axis: y
grid.color: "#EEF0F3"
grid.linewidth: 1
figure.titlesize: 17
legend.fontsize: 10
font.size: 10.5
xtick.labelsize: 10.5
ytick.labelsize: 10.5
